WEBVTT

00:11:03.116 --> 00:11:04.676
In 1992,

00:11:04.716 --> 00:11:06.916
the city of Sarajevo was under siege.

00:11:07.956 --> 00:11:11.196
For centuries, Muslims,
Catholics and Eastern Orthodox

00:11:11.196 --> 00:11:14.396
had lived together
in this very vibrant city.

00:11:15.316 --> 00:11:18.196
And now, the streets were dead quiet.

00:11:18.196 --> 00:11:21.076
Except for the crackling sounds
of the snipers' gunshots.

00:11:22.356 --> 00:11:23.716
Until one day,

00:11:23.756 --> 00:11:25.516
when a bombed-out bakery

00:11:25.556 --> 00:11:29.556
filled with the strains
of Albinoni's "Adagio in G Minor,"

00:11:29.596 --> 00:11:31.716
which is what you've just
been listening to,